Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.70,0:01:10.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打扫干净  活在美梦里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:10.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Makin' it clean, I'm living a dream
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.17,0:01:11.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闪亮登场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:11.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Makin' the scene
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在打扫干净
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm makin' it clean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.40,0:01:14.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在打扫干净
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:14.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm makin' it clean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.75,0:01:16.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:16.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm makin' it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干净
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  你干嘛在打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, what are you cleaning for?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.14,0:01:24.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为有位非常重要的客人要来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:24.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm expecting some very important company
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.88,0:01:25.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:25.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的姐姐派大珊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My big sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.89,0:01:30.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道你有姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:30.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had a sister
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody does
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.80,0:01:37.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小时候  我们在海浪里走散了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:37.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I lost her in the surf when we were kids
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真替你难过  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm sorry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.73,0:01:42.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从小都是派大珊在照顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:42.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sam took care of me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.16,0:01:45.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那会儿我还在吃珊瑚  没断奶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:45.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when I was just nursing on coral
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.65,0:01:46.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她就是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:46.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She was my--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.83,0:01:48.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:48.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.32,0:01:49.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:49.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rock
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.86,0:01:54.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:54.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今天就要跟她重逢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna see her again today
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.14,0:01:57.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:01:57.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.89,0:01:58.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:58.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.03,0:02:00.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,振作一点  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.03,0:02:00.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheer up, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.14,0:02:02.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会让她今天的拜访
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:02.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure her visit here
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.28,0:02:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无论如何都会超级无敌特别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will be extra-super-special, no matter what
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.82,0:02:05.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:05.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.80,0:02:06.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:06.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.21,0:02:09.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我等不及要弥补错过的岁月了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:09.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to make up for our lost years
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个能不能别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you two pipe down?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.41,0:02:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.40,0:02:16.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在整理我家  等姐姐来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:16.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was getting my place ready for my sister
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望她没你那么恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope she's not as obnoxious as you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.01,0:02:38.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:38.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.26,0:02:46.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:46.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brubber
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.55,0:02:47.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:47.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sis
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能再见到你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有好多旧要叙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have much catch up to do
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你力气好大  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You pack a wallop, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.32,0:03:08.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊  这是我最好的朋友海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:08.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sam, this is my best friend SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.82,0:03:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  我跟派大星认识很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Patrick and I go back a long way
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Long way
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.08,0:03:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Long way
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄色方块
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yellow square
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,碰底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,touch brubber
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让派大珊姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.55,0:03:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mad
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特地打扫了我的石头屋等你来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cleaned my rock just for you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside and play
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屋子太小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,House too small
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make bigger
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great idea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.32,0:03:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去拿工具就
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just go get some tools and--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.80,0:03:38.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:38.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,工具都在这
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have all tools here
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.93,0:03:56.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王啊  没听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:56.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear Neptune, didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.67,0:04:13.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:13.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.12,0:04:18.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐爱给底迪做石头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:18.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam loves to make rock for brubber
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.27,0:04:20.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去别处做石头吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:20.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, "make rock" someplace else
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.69,0:04:21.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家里全是沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:21.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house is full of sand
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果大鼻子不喜欢沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If big nose no like sand
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大鼻子搬走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Big nose move
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都严重侵犯我家地界了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is way beyond my property line
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.07,0:04:34.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:34.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.32,0:04:38.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那头畸形儿当姐姐还不如当推土机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:38.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that oaf makes a better bulldozer than a sister
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,建筑笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Construction humor
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No laughing
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要  别因为章鱼哥不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, don't be upset with Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他不是有意的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He doesn't mean it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当然是有意的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean it, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她就是一白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's a big buffoon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.05,0:04:51.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只不过更大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:51.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Except bigger
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还更笨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And dumber
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还更白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And buffoonier
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你真会说笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squidward, you jokester
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说她是不是有点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you think she looks a little
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.30,0:05:03.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恼火了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:03.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Miffed?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.59,0:05:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些男的好坏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those boys mean
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.06,0:05:19.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找派大珊姐姐的茬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:19.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They pick on sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个羞羞脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shame on you two
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.42,0:05:23.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看你们干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:23.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看我们干什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look what we've done?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太厉害了  克林特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Golly gee diddly, Clint
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,投得真准
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was a nice toss
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.31,0:05:39.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是我  塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:39.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Weren't me, Tucker
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赌那边那位小姐姐赢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My money's on the little missy over yonder
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.87,0:05:44.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:44.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.20,0:05:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别听那些坏蛋乱讲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to those meanies
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新石头  看着有点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The new rock, it's lookin' kinda
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,boring
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说要不要装饰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say we decorate it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.49,0:05:56.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钻室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:56.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blecorate?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你爱怎么叫就怎么叫  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You could call it whatever you like, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要能漂漂亮亮就行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just as long as we make it spiffy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让新家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make new house
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂漂亮亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spiffy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂漂亮亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spiffy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.11,0:06:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不能那样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't do that
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我家窗户
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's my window
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钻室
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blecorate
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.48,0:06:26.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样就对了  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:26.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样绝对不对  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is definitely not the spirit, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.77,0:06:31.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你姐姐失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:31.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your sister is outta control
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.35,0:06:34.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,管好你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:34.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just mind your own business
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.27,0:06:36.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我们好好钻室
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:36.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and let us blecorate in peace
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们可以钻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can blecor--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,装饰多久就装多久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,decorate until the sea cows come home
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for all I care
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.55,0:06:43.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之就是不准用我的财产
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:43.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just do not use my property to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更漂漂亮亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More spiffy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可那是从
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's from
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家偷的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.65,0:06:55.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经受够这么个小偷畜生了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:55.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have had my fill of this thieving brute
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你竟然敢管我姐叫小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How dare you call my sister a thief
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只因为她拿了点你的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just 'cause she took some of your things
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家别急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy now, gents
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要大动肝火
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's not let tempers flare
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你难道不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, don't you think, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.00,0:07:11.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐拆章鱼哥家有一点过分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that it's a teensie bit unfair
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:11.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that sister Sam dismantled Squidward's house?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.40,0:07:12.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:12.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且更别提一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not even a teensie
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.55,0:07:16.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:16.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,eensie
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一丁点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Teensie bit
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.38,0:07:22.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看得出来你不仅反对我姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see now that not only have you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,turned against my sister
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还跟你最好的朋友反目成仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you've turned on your best friend as well
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本没那回事  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not like that at all, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.19,0:07:27.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:27.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.02,0:07:32.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏蛋让底迪眼睛都是水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:32.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meanies make brubber's eyes water
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏蛋回家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meanies go home
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走吧  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回石头底下  他们就烦不了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They can't bother us under our rock
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.97,0:07:46.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏蛋好坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:46.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meanies is mean
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.53,0:07:57.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:57.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先别冲动行事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Before you do anything too rash
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来跟他们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let me try to talk to them
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谈判时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The time for talk is over
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在是行动时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now is the time for action
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,俩白痴用沙子做的石头屋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A rock made out of sand by two idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可敌不过我这一块
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is no match for one carved from the--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时间冲刷的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tides of time
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不应该那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should do that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁理你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who cares what you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们要是想拆家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If it's destruction they want
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就给他们拆家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's destruction they'll get
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁发声音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who makes noise?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.55,0:08:34.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂漂亮亮坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:34.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spiffy broken
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姐姐生气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister mad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊  事情不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, Sam, it's not what it seems
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥只是在重新布置漂漂亮亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward was just rearranging the spiffy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐现在重新布置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam rearrange now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please don't
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  往好处想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Squidward, on the bright side
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.40,0:09:13.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就有动力去改造厨房了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:11.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this will motivate you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:13.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to finally take care of that kitchen remodel
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.25,0:09:17.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定是急着去改造了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:17.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must be eager to get started
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.14,0:09:23.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:23.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, stop
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先别急  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,松开油门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's ease that tentacle off the accelerator, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.67,0:09:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拆家太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet destruction
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.12,0:09:53.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样就能教训那些坏蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:53.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll teach those meanies
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还是我的石头  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're still my rock, big sis
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.45,0:09:59.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你姐姐的脾气好像快失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:58.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I think your sister's temper
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:09:59.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is getting out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.53,0:10:02.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你怎么还在说派大珊坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, why are you still
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:02.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,saying mean things about Sam?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一怒之下就拆了我家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She destroyed my house in a fit of rage
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得让她控制脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She needs to control her temper
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.54,0:10:10.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她有时候是有点忘乎所以了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:10.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess she can get a little carried away
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.13,0:10:12.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:12.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What Patrick doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星为什么跟坏蛋说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why Patrick talk to meanies?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, um
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.75,0:10:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚是说你的脾气  派大珊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's about your temper, Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No have temper
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.67,0:10:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害派大珊姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This makes sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.60,0:10:27.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好生气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:27.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so mad
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.30,0:10:32.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换上坏脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:32.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,put on mean face
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.52,0:10:37.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在砸底迪家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:37.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now smash brubber house
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别砸石头屋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the rock
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.41,0:10:48.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:48.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little brubber?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little brubber?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底迪没醒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little brubber no wake
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饼干面团
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cookie dough
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.03,0:11:10.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:10.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick okay
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.95,0:11:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐难过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam feel bad
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.97,0:11:17.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起伤害派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:17.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry she hurt Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.25,0:11:21.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该保护底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:21.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Should protect little brubber
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She go now
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姐姐  先别走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sis, no, hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别难过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't feel sad
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以不用走的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.10,0:11:28.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:28.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大珊姐姐要走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sister Sam must go
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.00,0:11:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,修指甲迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Late for manicure
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  底迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, brubber
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.14,0:11:38.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:38.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, sis
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我姐姐厉害不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gee, isn't my sister somethin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.83,0:11:50.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她可厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:50.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's somethin', all right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:54.77,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,一拍即合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(240,448)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:59.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(480,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:59.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(412,438)\frz29.51}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:59.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(540,682)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost done
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能把那扳手给我吗  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could you hand me that wrench, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lab partner
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚叫我海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You called me SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说好了的  要互相称呼正确的头衔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:19.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought we agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to address each other by our proper titles
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.59,0:12:22.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:22.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lab partner
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.22,0:12:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.05,0:12:28.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's finished
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我能把坚果藏回德克萨斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I can hide my nuts back in Texas
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而不用离开实验室了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,without leavin' my lab
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.57,0:12:47.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:47.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It worked
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We did it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真该死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw, nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678,686)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一天总算到来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The day has come
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.55,0:13:11.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说星期四吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:11.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean Thursday?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这天是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is the day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.39,0:13:16.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从老螃蟹那偷到蟹黄堡秘方的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:16.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I steal the Krabby Patty secret formula from Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.98,0:13:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么有把握
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why, pretell
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.11,0:13:22.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天会跟你没偷到秘方的日子不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is today different
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:22.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from the other days you failed to steal it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.53,0:13:27.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为今天我完成了我最伟大的发明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:27.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because today I've completed my greatest invention
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Behold
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.45,0:13:33.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你让我看的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:33.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What exactly am I beholding?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蔬菜蒸锅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A vegetable steamer?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可不是一般的蔬菜蒸锅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary vegetable steamer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的电脑老婆凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, my computer wife
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我的最新发明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my latest invention
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她是不是很美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And isn't she a beauty
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.80,0:13:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甜心  你会帮我达成终极目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, you're going to help me achieve
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,my devine purpose
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不对  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,aren't you, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并且偷到蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And steal the Krabby Patty recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.73,0:14:00.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:00.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's ready
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.36,0:14:08.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面好热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:08.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man, is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It worked
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.13,0:14:23.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我变成了气态
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:23.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In this new gaseous form
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能静悄悄地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will be able to silently
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从蟹堡王的缝里挤进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,squeeze through the cracks of the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:33.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(526,424)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.14,0:14:41.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:41.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总共有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, how much was--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个时刻总算到来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, the moment has come
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.84,0:15:09.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:09.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut it out
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.30,0:15:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然是我了  你这白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course it's me, you moron
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.51,0:15:16.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你居然能把自己转化成气态
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:16.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were able to convert yourself into gaseous form?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fascinatin'
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.16,0:15:35.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没发现过你这么会搞科研
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:33.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I never realized
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you were such a student of science
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.49,0:15:37.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你可以帮我修一下坚果传送器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:37.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could help me fix my nut transporter
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚说了传送器吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you say transporter?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果我把这设备跟我的发明结合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I combine this device with my own invention
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方就会是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Krabby Patty formula will be mine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我实验室应该有合适的零件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I have the right parts in my lab, maybe?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.14,0:15:58.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:58.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're in business
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524,714)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这实验室可真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, this is a dandy lab
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that good?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.69,0:16:06.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,猪会打扑克牌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:06.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does a pig play poker?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:08.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:08.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.23,0:16:09.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早知道我原先就该来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:09.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should have visited you before
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.24,0:16:13.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村就你和我是科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What with you and me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.15,0:16:13.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,bein' the only two scientists in town
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.86,0:16:14.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:14.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.37,0:16:24.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的实验室太神了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:24.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your lab is amazing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you really like it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.79,0:16:26.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:26.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And how
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.34,0:16:31.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,传送器来了  实验伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:31.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's your teleporter, lab partner
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能请你叫我实验伙伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you please call me lab partner?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:39.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把传送器连到哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:39.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So where do I hook up my teleporter?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.68,0:16:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把它插到那边那个玩意上面去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just plug it into that doohickey over there
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你管谁叫那个玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just who are you calling a doohickey?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是马克三代电脑全自动老婆机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that a real Mark III Surplus W.I.F.E.omatic?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她好美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She is beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那个玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, not that doohickey
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是这个玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This doohickey
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你的传送器插到我设备里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just plug your teleporter into my device
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了我们的组合拳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and with our combined might
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就能征服世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we shall conquer the world
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也可以把你的气化机跟我的发明结合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or I can combine your gasifier with my invention
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把我的坚果转化为气态云
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and transform my nuts into a gaseous cloud
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能传送回德州了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that transports them back to Texas
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.51,0:17:17.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我就是那意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:17.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what I meant
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.77,0:17:22.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:22.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总算成功了  新实验伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's working at last, new lab partner
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.60,0:17:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你再也不需要我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess you won't be needing me anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出去的时候别被门撞上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't let the door hit you on the way out
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.74,0:17:39.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:39.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不能走  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't go, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.16,0:17:41.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:41.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.83,0:17:42.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:42.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他会碍我们事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll just get in the way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.00,0:17:44.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:44.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要怎么帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could I help?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我甚至都不算
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not even a
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,scientist
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.83,0:17:51.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来负责最重要的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:51.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, you'll have the most important job of all
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就让你来当实验猴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be our test monkey
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验猴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Test monkey
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.43,0:18:03.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验猴报到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:03.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Test monkey reporting for duty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.93,0:18:05.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验猴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:05.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A test monkey?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.31,0:18:05.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:05.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以前从来没有实验猴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never had a test monkey before
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.31,0:18:13.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你终究还是有点疯狂科学家的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:13.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There is some mad scientist in you after all
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  还得再改进下你的邪恶笑声
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, we really have to work on your evil laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.99,0:18:23.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:23.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.87,0:18:24.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:24.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Roger
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a sec
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁把灯关了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who turned out the lights?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.81,0:18:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只传送了他的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We only teleported his eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.65,0:18:53.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:53.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.69,0:18:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个白痴海绵宝宝哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is that idiot SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,落下我一个人在这做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,leaving me stuck with all the cooking?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这工作又烂又臭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This job stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.66,0:19:03.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是真的臭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:03.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Literally
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.25,0:19:11.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你快跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:11.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta come with me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定要看一下厨房里的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's something in the kitchen you gotta see
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.96,0:19:17.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:17.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See for yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.06,0:19:28.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:28.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.43,0:19:31.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是你早先把我办公室弄臭的是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:31.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So it was you that befouled me office earlier, was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再做一点调整
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a few more adjustments
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let her rip
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打扮成这样好看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you think this is a good look for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.78,0:19:43.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是说太招摇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:43.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or is it too flashy?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stand clear
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要靠近什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clear of what?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.08,0:19:53.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这附近出了怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:53.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something weird is going on around here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.54,0:19:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,厕所里传来了怪声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a strange sound coming from the restroom
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.89,0:20:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在就他嘴巴消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now only his mouth is missing
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shut it down
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是岂有此理  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.15,0:20:17.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你到底有什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:17.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what the heck is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.44,0:20:21.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第三次测试
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:21.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Test 3
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.49,0:20:28.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得亲自把这堆垃圾食品递给客人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:28.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to deliver all this junk food myself
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.46,0:20:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.59,0:20:47.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看  没手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:47.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, no hands
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.85,0:20:48.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也没脚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:48.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or feet
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we're getting closer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goggles
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要一起启动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we activate it together?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.57,0:21:02.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊可以
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:02.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, sure enough
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.86,0:21:03.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:03.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Three
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.24,0:21:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fire
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.33,0:21:18.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得去上卫生间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:18.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta go to the bathroom
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.01,0:21:24.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:24.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune's trousers, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.13,0:21:27.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怕是得先戒掉一段时间的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:27.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should just lay off the broccoli for a while
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.64,0:21:30.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:30.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It worked
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这回我们成功把他全身传送过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We transported his whole body this time
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.64,0:21:36.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的计划达成了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:36.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My plan worked
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.39,0:21:40.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个大好人再也没有利用价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:40.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I have no further use for you two goody goodies
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要用你的高科技
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Using your technology
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.57,0:21:46.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就能把自己直接传送到蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:46.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I shall teleport myself directly to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will be mine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.91,0:21:54.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:54.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.70,0:21:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板最后还是赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton has finally won
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.37,0:21:57.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:21:57.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And we
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.33,0:21:58.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是他的帮凶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:21:58.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we helped him
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.17,0:22:00.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:22:00.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not exactly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.84,0:22:01.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实验伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:01.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,lab partner
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.47,0:22:10.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:10.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.47,0:22:11.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可要是秘方在这
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:11.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But if that's here
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.01,0:22:12.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那痞老板呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.01,0:22:12.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where's Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.22,0:22:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fools
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把他们耍得团团转
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I played them like a 32-bit synthesizer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.94,0:22:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在秘方在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now where is that formula?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The formula is gone?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.28,0:22:28.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:28.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.61,0:22:29.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:29.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.82,0:22:30.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:30.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't hear a thing
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有一股臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but something stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.99,0:22:35.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道痞老板自始至终都不安好心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:33.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew Plankton
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:35.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,was hatching an evil plan the whole time
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就调了一下控制器
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I just adjusted the controls
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.50,0:22:39.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把痞老板传到能让他没法作乱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:39.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to put Plankton where he can't do any harm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.58,0:22:41.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都骗不了德克萨斯的松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:41.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody fools a squirrel from Texas
